{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass, when he had been there a long time, etc.</b> Therefore Abimelech reasoned in his heart, saying: if she is truly his sister, then why does he not marry a woman all this long while? Surely there is something afoot. Therefore ״וַיַּשְׁקֵף אֲבִימֶלֶךְ בְּעַד הַחַלּוֹן״ — to see what his nature and affairs were."], :book :genesis, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:30:13.267359897Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}